{"id":"de-witze-1lhhz4p.en","jokeId":"de-witze-1lhhz4p","locale":"en","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Line-by-line translation; the three slightly different questions are kept as three lines. The wife's silences are pause beats while the husband visibly steps closer each time. Doctor's office, then a flyover home to the kitchen.","title":"Hard of Hearing","location":"bolnitsa","cast":["doktor","muzhik"],"roles":{"doktor":"doctor","muzhik":"husband"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"A man goes to the doctor.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Doctor, I think my wife is hard of hearing.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"doktor","text":"Speak to her from behind. Depending on how far away she reacts, we can judge it.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"narrator","text":"The man goes home and finds his wife in the kitchen, making dinner.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Honey, what are we eating today?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Honey, what's for dinner today?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Honey, what are we eating today?","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.8},{"character":"zhena","text":"I'm telling you now for the third time: we're having chicken!","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"bolnitsa","cast":["doktor","muzhik"],"roles":{"doktor":"doctor","muzhik":"husband"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"doktor","to":"desk"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","from":"off-left","to":"center"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"}]},{"location":"kukhnya","transition":"flyover","cast":["muzhik","zhena"],"roles":{"muzhik":"husband","zhena":"wife"},"looks":{"zhena":{"add":["apron"]}},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"fridge"},{"type":"move","who":"zhena","to":"stove"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"pause","sec":2},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"center"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"},{"type":"pause","sec":2},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"right"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"},{"type":"line","ref":"l8"}]}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1otfre9.de","jokeId":"de-witze-1otfre9","locale":"de","adaptation":"original","notes":"All spoken lines kept as written, long speeches split. Three phone legs: father and son in one shot at opposite marks, then son and sister, then sister and father; she walks off after slamming the phone down, he puts the phone down and turns to his wife on the sofa. Mist is mild, no uncensored needed.","title":"Die Scheidung","location":"gostinaya","cast":["ded","tyoshcha","paren"],"roles":{"ded":"old-man","tyoshcha":"old-woman","paren":"son"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Ein alter Mann ruft seinen Sohn an.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"ded","text":"Hör zu, deine Mutter und ich lassen uns scheiden.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"ded","text":"Fünfundvierzig Jahre von dem Mist reichen jetzt auch.","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"paren","text":"Was redest du da, Papa?!","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"ded","text":"Wir können uns einfach nicht mehr ab. Ich kann sie nicht mehr ansehen, es reicht.","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"ded","text":"Ich will darüber nicht diskutieren. Ruf deine Schwester an und sag ihr Bescheid.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"narrator","text":"Der Sohn ruft völlig panisch sofort seine Schwester an.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"devushka-ryzhaya","text":"Die lassen sich gar nix!","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"narrator","text":"Sie ruft direkt beim Vater an.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"devushka-ryzhaya","text":"Du lässt dich nicht scheiden! Wag's bloß nicht, irgendwas zu unterschreiben!","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"devushka-ryzhaya","text":"Wir kommen morgen beide nach Hause und klären das. Keinen Anwalt, keine Formulare, gar nichts! Verstanden?!","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"exit":["devushka-ryzhaya"]},{"character":"ded","text":"Gut. Beide kommen zu Weihnachten. Und zahlen dieses Jahr ihren Flug sogar selbst.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"gostinaya","cast":["ded","tyoshcha","paren"],"roles":{"ded":"old-man","tyoshcha":"old-woman","paren":"son"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"ded","to":"left"},{"type":"move","who":"tyoshcha","to":"sofa"},{"type":"move","who":"paren","to":"right"},{"type":"prop","who":"ded","item":"phone","action":"hold"},{"type":"prop","who":"paren","item":"phone","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"}]},{"location":"ulitsa","transition":"cut","cast":["paren","devushka-ryzhaya"],"roles":{"paren":"son","devushka-ryzhaya":"daughter"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"paren","to":"left"},{"type":"move","who":"devushka-ryzhaya","to":"right"},{"type":"prop","who":"paren","item":"phone","action":"hold"},{"type":"prop","who":"devushka-ryzhaya","item":"phone","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"},{"type":"line","ref":"l8"}]},{"location":"gostinaya","transition":"cut","cast":["ded","tyoshcha","devushka-ryzhaya"],"roles":{"ded":"old-man","tyoshcha":"old-woman","devushka-ryzhaya":"daughter"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"ded","to":"left"},{"type":"move","who":"tyoshcha","to":"sofa"},{"type":"move","who":"devushka-ryzhaya","to":"right"},{"type":"prop","who":"ded","item":"phone","action":"hold"},{"type":"prop","who":"devushka-ryzhaya","item":"phone","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l9"},{"type":"line","ref":"l10"},{"type":"line","ref":"l11"},{"type":"prop","who":"ded","item":"phone","action":"put"},{"type":"line","ref":"l12"}]}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1otfre9.ru","jokeId":"de-witze-1otfre9","locale":"ru","adaptation":"reworked","notes":"Close translation; per adaptNote Christmas became New Year, the holiday Russian families gather for. Staging as in the German original: three phone legs, the daughter walks off after hanging up, the father turns to his wife.","title":"Развод","location":"gostinaya","cast":["ded","tyoshcha","paren"],"roles":{"ded":"old-man","tyoshcha":"old-woman","paren":"son"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Старик звонит сыну.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"ded","text":"Слушай, мы с твоей матерью разводимся.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"ded","text":"Сорок пять лет этой фигни — и хватит.","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"paren","text":"Ты что такое говоришь, папа?!","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"ded","text":"Мы просто больше не выносим друг друга. Я на неё уже смотреть не могу, хватит.","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"ded","text":"Я не хочу это обсуждать. Позвони сестре и скажи ей.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"narrator","text":"Сын в полной панике тут же звонит сестре.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"devushka-ryzhaya","text":"Ничего они не разведутся!","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"narrator","text":"Она сразу звонит отцу.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"devushka-ryzhaya","text":"Ты не разводишься! Только попробуй что-нибудь подписать!","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"devushka-ryzhaya","text":"Мы завтра оба приедем домой и во всём разберёмся. Никаких адвокатов, никаких бумаг, ничего! Понял?!","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"exit":["devushka-ryzhaya"]},{"character":"ded","text":"Так. Оба приедут на Новый год. И в этот раз даже билеты на самолёт сами оплатят.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"gostinaya","cast":["ded","tyoshcha","paren"],"roles":{"ded":"old-man","tyoshcha":"old-woman","paren":"son"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"ded","to":"left"},{"type":"move","who":"tyoshcha","to":"sofa"},{"type":"move","who":"paren","to":"right"},{"type":"prop","who":"ded","item":"phone","action":"hold"},{"type":"prop","who":"paren","item":"phone","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"}]},{"location":"ulitsa","transition":"cut","cast":["paren","devushka-ryzhaya"],"roles":{"paren":"son","devushka-ryzhaya":"daughter"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"paren","to":"left"},{"type":"move","who":"devushka-ryzhaya","to":"right"},{"type":"prop","who":"paren","item":"phone","action":"hold"},{"type":"prop","who":"devushka-ryzhaya","item":"phone","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"},{"type":"line","ref":"l8"}]},{"location":"gostinaya","transition":"cut","cast":["ded","tyoshcha","devushka-ryzhaya"],"roles":{"ded":"old-man","tyoshcha":"old-woman","devushka-ryzhaya":"daughter"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"ded","to":"left"},{"type":"move","who":"tyoshcha","to":"sofa"},{"type":"move","who":"devushka-ryzhaya","to":"right"},{"type":"prop","who":"ded","item":"phone","action":"hold"},{"type":"prop","who":"devushka-ryzhaya","item":"phone","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l9"},{"type":"line","ref":"l10"},{"type":"line","ref":"l11"},{"type":"prop","who":"ded","item":"phone","action":"put"},{"type":"line","ref":"l12"}]}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1otfre9.en","jokeId":"de-witze-1otfre9","locale":"en","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Close translation, Christmas kept. Mist rendered as crap (mild, no softening needed). Same three-leg phone staging as the original.","title":"The Divorce","location":"gostinaya","cast":["ded","tyoshcha","paren"],"roles":{"ded":"old-man","tyoshcha":"old-woman","paren":"son"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"An old man calls his son.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"ded","text":"Listen, your mother and I are getting divorced.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"ded","text":"Forty-five years of this crap is enough.","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"paren","text":"What are you talking about, Dad?!","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"ded","text":"We just can't stand each other anymore. I can't even look at her, I've had enough.","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"ded","text":"I don't want to discuss it. Call your sister and let her know.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"narrator","text":"The son, in a total panic, calls his sister right away.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"devushka-ryzhaya","text":"They're not getting divorced at all!","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"narrator","text":"She calls her father directly.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"devushka-ryzhaya","text":"You are not getting divorced! Don't you dare sign anything!","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"devushka-ryzhaya","text":"We're both coming home tomorrow and we'll sort this out. No lawyer, no forms, nothing! Understood?!","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"exit":["devushka-ryzhaya"]},{"character":"ded","text":"Good. They're both coming for Christmas. And this year they're even paying for their own flights.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"gostinaya","cast":["ded","tyoshcha","paren"],"roles":{"ded":"old-man","tyoshcha":"old-woman","paren":"son"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"ded","to":"left"},{"type":"move","who":"tyoshcha","to":"sofa"},{"type":"move","who":"paren","to":"right"},{"type":"prop","who":"ded","item":"phone","action":"hold"},{"type":"prop","who":"paren","item":"phone","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"}]},{"location":"ulitsa","transition":"cut","cast":["paren","devushka-ryzhaya"],"roles":{"paren":"son","devushka-ryzhaya":"daughter"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"paren","to":"left"},{"type":"move","who":"devushka-ryzhaya","to":"right"},{"type":"prop","who":"paren","item":"phone","action":"hold"},{"type":"prop","who":"devushka-ryzhaya","item":"phone","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"},{"type":"line","ref":"l8"}]},{"location":"gostinaya","transition":"cut","cast":["ded","tyoshcha","devushka-ryzhaya"],"roles":{"ded":"old-man","tyoshcha":"old-woman","devushka-ryzhaya":"daughter"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"ded","to":"left"},{"type":"move","who":"tyoshcha","to":"sofa"},{"type":"move","who":"devushka-ryzhaya","to":"right"},{"type":"prop","who":"ded","item":"phone","action":"hold"},{"type":"prop","who":"devushka-ryzhaya","item":"phone","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l9"},{"type":"line","ref":"l10"},{"type":"line","ref":"l11"},{"type":"prop","who":"ded","item":"phone","action":"put"},{"type":"line","ref":"l12"}]}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1xrms30.de","jokeId":"de-witze-1xrms30","locale":"de","adaptation":"original","notes":"The poster's question 'was denkt ihr?' dropped; the study claim kept as a one-line hook. Both hunters on screen (the second one silent, hunter hat), the dispatcher is a man per the source, so the young guy with a headset instead of the teacher. Cross-cut forest / office / forest. The shot is narrated; a rifle is requested.","title":"Der beste Witz","location":"derevnya","cast":["muzhik-sosed","muzhik-ryzhy"],"roles":{"muzhik-sosed":"hunter","muzhik-ryzhy":"hunter"},"needs":[{"kind":"prop","id":"rifle","description":"a hunting rifle held by a hunter","why":"the hunter has to be visibly armed so the shot is clearly his"}],"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Laut einer wissenschaftlichen Studie der beste Witz.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"narrator","text":"Zwei Jäger sind im Wald, als einer von beiden plötzlich zusammenbricht. Er atmet nicht mehr und sein Blick ist starr.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik-ryzhy","text":"Mein Freund ist tot! Was soll ich bloß tun?","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"paren","text":"Ganz ruhig, ich kann Ihnen helfen. Stellen Sie als Erstes absolut sicher, dass er wirklich tot ist.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"narrator","text":"Am Telefon ist kurz Stille, dann hört man einen lauten Schuss.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.8},{"character":"muzhik-ryzhy","text":"Okay, erledigt. Und was jetzt?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"derevnya","place":"forest","cast":["muzhik-sosed","muzhik-ryzhy"],"roles":{"muzhik-sosed":"hunter","muzhik-ryzhy":"hunter"},"looks":{"muzhik-sosed":{"add":["tyrolean-hat"]}},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"muzhik-sosed","to":"tree"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik-ryzhy","to":"center"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik-ryzhy","item":"phone","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"}]},{"location":"ofis","transition":"cut","cast":["paren"],"roles":{"paren":"operator"},"looks":{"paren":{"add":["headset"]}},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"paren","to":"desk"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"}]},{"location":"derevnya","place":"forest","transition":"cut","cast":["muzhik-sosed","muzhik-ryzhy"],"roles":{"muzhik-sosed":"hunter","muzhik-ryzhy":"hunter"},"looks":{"muzhik-sosed":{"add":["tyrolean-hat"]}},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"muzhik-sosed","to":"tree"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik-ryzhy","to":"center"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik-ryzhy","item":"phone","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"}]}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1xrms30.ru","jokeId":"de-witze-1xrms30","locale":"ru","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Close translation; the study claim kept as the hook, the poster's question dropped. Male dispatcher (young guy with headset), both hunters on screen, cross-cut forest / office / forest; rifle requested.","title":"Лучший анекдот","location":"derevnya","cast":["muzhik-sosed","muzhik-ryzhy"],"roles":{"muzhik-sosed":"hunter","muzhik-ryzhy":"hunter"},"needs":[{"kind":"prop","id":"rifle","description":"a hunting rifle held by a hunter","why":"the hunter has to be visibly armed so the shot is clearly his"}],"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"По данным научного исследования — лучший анекдот.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"narrator","text":"Двое охотников в лесу, и вдруг один из них падает. Он не дышит, взгляд застыл.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik-ryzhy","text":"Мой друг умер! Что же мне делать?","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"paren","text":"Спокойно, я могу вам помочь. Для начала абсолютно точно убедитесь, что он действительно мёртв.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"narrator","text":"В трубке ненадолго тишина, потом раздаётся громкий выстрел.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.8},{"character":"muzhik-ryzhy","text":"Так, готово. А теперь что?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"derevnya","place":"forest","cast":["muzhik-sosed","muzhik-ryzhy"],"roles":{"muzhik-sosed":"hunter","muzhik-ryzhy":"hunter"},"looks":{"muzhik-sosed":{"add":["tyrolean-hat"]}},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"muzhik-sosed","to":"tree"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik-ryzhy","to":"center"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik-ryzhy","item":"phone","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"}]},{"location":"ofis","transition":"cut","cast":["paren"],"roles":{"paren":"operator"},"looks":{"paren":{"add":["headset"]}},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"paren","to":"desk"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"}]},{"location":"derevnya","place":"forest","transition":"cut","cast":["muzhik-sosed","muzhik-ryzhy"],"roles":{"muzhik-sosed":"hunter","muzhik-ryzhy":"hunter"},"looks":{"muzhik-sosed":{"add":["tyrolean-hat"]}},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"muzhik-sosed","to":"tree"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik-ryzhy","to":"center"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik-ryzhy","item":"phone","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"}]}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1xrms30.en","jokeId":"de-witze-1xrms30","locale":"en","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Close translation; the study claim kept as the hook, the poster's question dropped. Male dispatcher (young guy with headset), both hunters on screen, cross-cut forest / office / forest; rifle requested.","title":"The Best Joke","location":"derevnya","cast":["muzhik-sosed","muzhik-ryzhy"],"roles":{"muzhik-sosed":"hunter","muzhik-ryzhy":"hunter"},"needs":[{"kind":"prop","id":"rifle","description":"a hunting rifle held by a hunter","why":"the hunter has to be visibly armed so the shot is clearly his"}],"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"According to a scientific study, this is the best joke.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"narrator","text":"Two hunters are in the woods when one of them suddenly collapses. He isn't breathing and his eyes are glazed over.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik-ryzhy","text":"My friend is dead! What am I supposed to do?","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"paren","text":"Calm down, I can help you. First, make absolutely sure that he's really dead.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"narrator","text":"There's a brief silence on the line, then a loud shot.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.8},{"character":"muzhik-ryzhy","text":"Okay, done. Now what?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"derevnya","place":"forest","cast":["muzhik-sosed","muzhik-ryzhy"],"roles":{"muzhik-sosed":"hunter","muzhik-ryzhy":"hunter"},"looks":{"muzhik-sosed":{"add":["tyrolean-hat"]}},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"muzhik-sosed","to":"tree"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik-ryzhy","to":"center"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik-ryzhy","item":"phone","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"}]},{"location":"ofis","transition":"cut","cast":["paren"],"roles":{"paren":"operator"},"looks":{"paren":{"add":["headset"]}},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"paren","to":"desk"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"}]},{"location":"derevnya","place":"forest","transition":"cut","cast":["muzhik-sosed","muzhik-ryzhy"],"roles":{"muzhik-sosed":"hunter","muzhik-ryzhy":"hunter"},"looks":{"muzhik-sosed":{"add":["tyrolean-hat"]}},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"muzhik-sosed","to":"tree"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik-ryzhy","to":"center"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik-ryzhy","item":"phone","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"}]}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1bl8rd2.de","jokeId":"de-witze-1bl8rd2","locale":"de","adaptation":"original","notes":"Post title 'Wer ist dumm' dropped. All spoken lines as written; the money passes from barber to boy on screen and he walks out, then a cut outside the shop where the customer walks up to him. The boy is not named.","title":"Das dümmste Kind","location":"magazin","cast":["vovochka","muzhik","barmen"],"roles":{"vovochka":"child","muzhik":"customer","barmen":"craftsman"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Ein kleiner Junge kommt in den Friseurladen.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"barmen","text":"Das ist das dümmste Kind der Stadt. Passen Sie mal auf.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"narrator","text":"Er nimmt einen Fünf-Euro-Schein in eine Hand und zwei Ein-Euro-Münzen in die andere.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"barmen","text":"Na, Junge, such dir eine Hand aus. Welche willst du?","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"narrator","text":"Der Junge nimmt die zwei Münzen und geht.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"barmen","text":"Na, was hab ich Ihnen gesagt?","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"narrator","text":"Etwas später verlässt der Kunde den Salon. Draußen sieht er den Jungen an der Eisdiele gegenüber stehen.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Hey Kleiner, ich hab da mal 'ne Frage. Warum nimmst du die zwei Euro und nicht den Fünfer?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.8},{"character":"vovochka","text":"An dem Tag, an dem ich den Schein nehme, ist das Spiel vorbei.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"magazin","cast":["vovochka","muzhik","barmen"],"roles":{"vovochka":"child","muzhik":"customer","barmen":"craftsman"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"center"},{"type":"move","who":"barmen","to":"counter"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"move","who":"vovochka","from":"off-left","to":"left"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"prop","who":"barmen","item":"money","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"},{"type":"prop","who":"barmen","item":"money","action":"give","to":"vovochka"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"move","who":"vovochka","to":"off-left"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"}]},{"location":"ulitsa","transition":"cut","cast":["vovochka","muzhik"],"roles":{"vovochka":"child","muzhik":"customer"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"vovochka","to":"shop"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","from":"off-right","to":"center"},{"type":"line","ref":"l8"},{"type":"line","ref":"l9"}]}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1bl8rd2.ru","jokeId":"de-witze-1bl8rd2","locale":"ru","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Close translation; money localised to a hundred-rouble note versus two ten-rouble coins, keeping the bigger-note-versus-coins contrast. Same staging: the money changes hands, the boy leaves, then outside the shop.","title":"Самый глупый ребёнок","location":"magazin","cast":["vovochka","muzhik","barmen"],"roles":{"vovochka":"child","muzhik":"customer","barmen":"craftsman"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Маленький мальчик заходит в парикмахерскую.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"barmen","text":"Это самый глупый ребёнок в городе. Смотрите.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"narrator","text":"Он берёт в одну руку купюру в сто рублей, а в другую — две монеты по десять.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"barmen","text":"Ну, малец, выбирай руку. Какую хочешь?","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"narrator","text":"Мальчик берёт две монеты и уходит.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"barmen","text":"Ну, что я вам говорил?","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"narrator","text":"Чуть позже клиент выходит из парикмахерской. На улице он видит мальчика у кафе-мороженого напротив.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Эй, малыш, можно вопрос? Почему ты берёшь две монеты, а не сотню?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.8},{"character":"vovochka","text":"В тот день, когда я возьму бумажку, игра закончится.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"magazin","cast":["vovochka","muzhik","barmen"],"roles":{"vovochka":"child","muzhik":"customer","barmen":"craftsman"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"center"},{"type":"move","who":"barmen","to":"counter"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"move","who":"vovochka","from":"off-left","to":"left"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"prop","who":"barmen","item":"money","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"},{"type":"prop","who":"barmen","item":"money","action":"give","to":"vovochka"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"move","who":"vovochka","to":"off-left"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"}]},{"location":"ulitsa","transition":"cut","cast":["vovochka","muzhik"],"roles":{"vovochka":"child","muzhik":"customer"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"vovochka","to":"shop"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","from":"off-right","to":"center"},{"type":"line","ref":"l8"},{"type":"line","ref":"l9"}]}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1bl8rd2.en","jokeId":"de-witze-1bl8rd2","locale":"en","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Close translation; money localised to a five-dollar bill versus two quarters (dollar coins are rare in the US). Same staging: the money changes hands, the boy leaves, then outside the shop.","title":"The Dumbest Kid in Town","location":"magazin","cast":["vovochka","muzhik","barmen"],"roles":{"vovochka":"child","muzhik":"customer","barmen":"craftsman"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"A little boy walks into the barbershop.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"barmen","text":"That's the dumbest kid in town. Watch this.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"narrator","text":"He holds a five-dollar bill in one hand and two quarters in the other.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"barmen","text":"Well, kid, pick a hand. Which one do you want?","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"narrator","text":"The boy takes the two quarters and leaves.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"barmen","text":"Well, what did I tell you?","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"narrator","text":"A little later the customer leaves the shop. Outside he sees the boy at the ice cream stand across the street.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Hey, kid, can I ask you something? Why do you take the two quarters and not the five?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.8},{"character":"vovochka","text":"The day I take the bill, the game is over.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"magazin","cast":["vovochka","muzhik","barmen"],"roles":{"vovochka":"child","muzhik":"customer","barmen":"craftsman"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"center"},{"type":"move","who":"barmen","to":"counter"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"move","who":"vovochka","from":"off-left","to":"left"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"prop","who":"barmen","item":"money","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"},{"type":"prop","who":"barmen","item":"money","action":"give","to":"vovochka"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"move","who":"vovochka","to":"off-left"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"}]},{"location":"ulitsa","transition":"cut","cast":["vovochka","muzhik"],"roles":{"vovochka":"child","muzhik":"customer"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"vovochka","to":"shop"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","from":"off-right","to":"center"},{"type":"line","ref":"l8"},{"type":"line","ref":"l9"}]}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1leukfr.de","jokeId":"de-witze-1leukfr","locale":"de","adaptation":"original","notes":"The crossed-out opener is voiced as a self-correction so the gag survives in speech. Phone call in one shot at opposite marks, then a cut to the flooded bathroom where the plumber arrives with his wrench. Washers and water are narrated.","title":"Notfall am Sonntag","location":"gostinaya","cast":["barmen","doktor"],"roles":{"barmen":"plumber","doktor":"doctor"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Kommt ein Mann zum Arzt… nein: Kommt ein Arzt zum Klempner.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"narrator","text":"Also, er ruft an. Notfall und so, Rohrbruch, Drama.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"barmen","text":"Ja gut, aber es ist Sonntagabend, es gießt wie aus Eimern und ich hab auch schon das zweite Bier am Wickel.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"doktor","text":"Guter Mann! Ich bin Arzt, wenn bei mir ein Notfall ist, muss ich auch raus, egal was ist!","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"narrator","text":"Hin und Her. Der Klempner hockt sich ins Auto und fährt hin. Der Arzt führt ihn direkt ins Badezimmer. Alles unter Wasser.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"narrator","text":"Der Klempner greift in die Hosentasche und schmeißt 'ne Handvoll Dichtungsringe ins Wasser.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.7},{"character":"barmen","text":"Wenn's morgen nicht besser ist, rufen Sie nochmal an!","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"gostinaya","cast":["barmen","doktor"],"roles":{"barmen":"plumber","doktor":"doctor"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"barmen","to":"left"},{"type":"move","who":"doktor","to":"right"},{"type":"prop","who":"barmen","item":"phone","action":"hold"},{"type":"prop","who":"doktor","item":"phone","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"}]},{"location":"spalnya","transition":"cut","cast":["barmen","doktor"],"roles":{"barmen":"plumber","doktor":"doctor"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"doktor","to":"center"},{"type":"move","who":"barmen","from":"off-left","to":"left"},{"type":"prop","who":"barmen","item":"wrench","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"}]}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1leukfr.ru","jokeId":"de-witze-1leukfr","locale":"ru","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Close translation; the crossed-out opener is voiced as a self-correction on the classic «Приходит мужик к врачу». Phone call in one shot, then a cut to the flooded bathroom.","title":"Экстренный вызов","location":"gostinaya","cast":["barmen","doktor"],"roles":{"barmen":"plumber","doktor":"doctor"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Приходит мужик к врачу… нет: приходит врач к сантехнику.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"narrator","text":"В общем, звонит он. Авария, трубу прорвало, драма.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"barmen","text":"Ну ладно, но сейчас воскресенье вечер, льёт как из ведра, и я уже за второе пиво взялся.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"doktor","text":"Любезный! Я врач, когда у меня экстренный случай, я тоже обязан ехать, что бы ни было!","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"narrator","text":"Слово за слово. Сантехник садится в машину и едет. Врач ведёт его прямо в ванную. Всё под водой.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"narrator","text":"Сантехник лезет в карман и бросает в воду горсть прокладок.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.7},{"character":"barmen","text":"Если до завтра не станет лучше, позвоните ещё раз!","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"gostinaya","cast":["barmen","doktor"],"roles":{"barmen":"plumber","doktor":"doctor"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"barmen","to":"left"},{"type":"move","who":"doktor","to":"right"},{"type":"prop","who":"barmen","item":"phone","action":"hold"},{"type":"prop","who":"doktor","item":"phone","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"}]},{"location":"spalnya","transition":"cut","cast":["barmen","doktor"],"roles":{"barmen":"plumber","doktor":"doctor"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"doktor","to":"center"},{"type":"move","who":"barmen","from":"off-left","to":"left"},{"type":"prop","who":"barmen","item":"wrench","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"}]}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1leukfr.en","jokeId":"de-witze-1leukfr","locale":"en","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Close translation; the crossed-out opener is voiced as a self-correction on 'a man goes to the doctor'. Phone call in one shot, then a cut to the flooded bathroom.","title":"Sunday Emergency","location":"gostinaya","cast":["barmen","doktor"],"roles":{"barmen":"plumber","doktor":"doctor"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"A man goes to the doctor… no: a doctor goes to the plumber.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"narrator","text":"Well, he calls him. Emergency, burst pipe, drama.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"barmen","text":"Yeah, okay, but it's Sunday night, it's pouring buckets, and I'm already on my second beer.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"doktor","text":"My good man! I'm a doctor. When I have an emergency, I have to go out too, no matter what!","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"narrator","text":"Back and forth. The plumber gets in his car and drives over. The doctor leads him straight to the bathroom. Everything is under water.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"narrator","text":"The plumber reaches into his pocket and tosses a handful of washers into the water.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.7},{"character":"barmen","text":"If it's not better by tomorrow, call me again!","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"gostinaya","cast":["barmen","doktor"],"roles":{"barmen":"plumber","doktor":"doctor"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"barmen","to":"left"},{"type":"move","who":"doktor","to":"right"},{"type":"prop","who":"barmen","item":"phone","action":"hold"},{"type":"prop","who":"doktor","item":"phone","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"}]},{"location":"spalnya","transition":"cut","cast":["barmen","doktor"],"roles":{"barmen":"plumber","doktor":"doctor"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"doktor","to":"center"},{"type":"move","who":"barmen","from":"off-left","to":"left"},{"type":"prop","who":"barmen","item":"wrench","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"}]}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1rn7sko.de","jokeId":"de-witze-1rn7sko","locale":"de","adaptation":"original","notes":"Letters staged like a phone call: wife and jailed farmer (prisoner costume) at opposite marks of the potato garden, each holding a letter. Two police officers walk in when she writes about them and walk off again; the second 'schreibt zurück' cut so the punchline follows straight on.","title":"Der Kartoffelacker","location":"derevnya","cast":["zhena","sluzhivy","sluzhivy-ryadovoy","muzhik"],"roles":{"zhena":"wife","sluzhivy":"police-officer","sluzhivy-ryadovoy":"police-officer","muzhik":"prisoner"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Ein Bauer muss wegen Diebstahls ins Gefängnis. Die Bäuerin schreibt ihm.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"zhena","text":"Glaub bloß nicht, dass ich nun den Kartoffelacker allein umgrabe.","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"narrator","text":"Der Bauer schreibt zurück.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.2},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Hände weg vom Kartoffelacker! Da ist doch die ganze Beute drin.","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"narrator","text":"Eine Woche später schreibt die Bäuerin.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.2},{"character":"zhena","text":"Jemand im Gefängnis muss deinen Brief gelesen haben.","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"zhena","text":"Gestern waren unzählige Polizisten hier. Sie haben den ganzen Acker umgegraben.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"zhena","text":"Gefunden haben sie jedoch nichts.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.8},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Bestens, jetzt kannst du die Kartoffeln setzen.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"derevnya","place":"garden","cast":["zhena","sluzhivy","sluzhivy-ryadovoy","muzhik"],"roles":{"zhena":"wife","sluzhivy":"police-officer","sluzhivy-ryadovoy":"police-officer","muzhik":"prisoner"},"looks":{"zhena":{"add":["headscarf","apron"]},"sluzhivy-ryadovoy":{"add":["police-cap"],"remove":["army-cap"]}},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"zhena","to":"left"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"right"},{"type":"prop","who":"zhena","item":"letter","action":"hold"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik","item":"letter","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"},{"type":"move","who":"sluzhivy","from":"off-right","to":"center"},{"type":"move","who":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","from":"off-right","to":"fence"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"},{"type":"line","ref":"l8"},{"type":"move","who":"sluzhivy","to":"off-left"},{"type":"move","who":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","to":"off-left"},{"type":"line","ref":"l9"}]}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1rn7sko.ru","jokeId":"de-witze-1rn7sko","locale":"ru","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Close translation. Letters staged like a phone call in the potato garden; two police officers walk in when she writes about them and walk off before the punchline.","title":"Картофельное поле","location":"derevnya","cast":["zhena","sluzhivy","sluzhivy-ryadovoy","muzhik"],"roles":{"zhena":"wife","sluzhivy":"police-officer","sluzhivy-ryadovoy":"police-officer","muzhik":"prisoner"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Фермера сажают в тюрьму за кражу. Жена пишет ему.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"zhena","text":"Даже не думай, что я теперь одна буду перекапывать картофельное поле.","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"narrator","text":"Фермер пишет в ответ.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.2},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Не трогай картофельное поле! Там же вся добыча.","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"narrator","text":"Через неделю жена пишет снова.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.2},{"character":"zhena","text":"Кто-то в тюрьме, видно, прочитал твоё письмо.","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"zhena","text":"Вчера тут была тьма полицейских. Они перекопали всё поле.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"zhena","text":"Но так ничего и не нашли.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.8},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Отлично, теперь можешь сажать картошку.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"derevnya","place":"garden","cast":["zhena","sluzhivy","sluzhivy-ryadovoy","muzhik"],"roles":{"zhena":"wife","sluzhivy":"police-officer","sluzhivy-ryadovoy":"police-officer","muzhik":"prisoner"},"looks":{"zhena":{"add":["headscarf","apron"]},"sluzhivy-ryadovoy":{"add":["police-cap"],"remove":["army-cap"]}},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"zhena","to":"left"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"right"},{"type":"prop","who":"zhena","item":"letter","action":"hold"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik","item":"letter","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"},{"type":"move","who":"sluzhivy","from":"off-right","to":"center"},{"type":"move","who":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","from":"off-right","to":"fence"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"},{"type":"line","ref":"l8"},{"type":"move","who":"sluzhivy","to":"off-left"},{"type":"move","who":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","to":"off-left"},{"type":"line","ref":"l9"}]}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1rn7sko.en","jokeId":"de-witze-1rn7sko","locale":"en","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Close translation. Letters staged like a phone call in the potato garden; two police officers walk in when she writes about them and walk off before the punchline.","title":"The Potato Field","location":"derevnya","cast":["zhena","sluzhivy","sluzhivy-ryadovoy","muzhik"],"roles":{"zhena":"wife","sluzhivy":"police-officer","sluzhivy-ryadovoy":"police-officer","muzhik":"prisoner"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"A farmer goes to prison for theft. His wife writes to him.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"zhena","text":"Don't you think I'm going to dig up the potato field all by myself now.","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"narrator","text":"The farmer writes back.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.2},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Hands off the potato field! That's where all the loot is.","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"narrator","text":"A week later his wife writes again.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.2},{"character":"zhena","text":"Someone in the prison must have read your letter.","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"zhena","text":"Yesterday there were countless police officers here. They dug up the whole field.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"zhena","text":"But they didn't find a thing.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.8},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Excellent, now you can plant the potatoes.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"derevnya","place":"garden","cast":["zhena","sluzhivy","sluzhivy-ryadovoy","muzhik"],"roles":{"zhena":"wife","sluzhivy":"police-officer","sluzhivy-ryadovoy":"police-officer","muzhik":"prisoner"},"looks":{"zhena":{"add":["headscarf","apron"]},"sluzhivy-ryadovoy":{"add":["police-cap"],"remove":["army-cap"]}},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"zhena","to":"left"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"right"},{"type":"prop","who":"zhena","item":"letter","action":"hold"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik","item":"letter","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"},{"type":"move","who":"sluzhivy","from":"off-right","to":"center"},{"type":"move","who":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","from":"off-right","to":"fence"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"},{"type":"line","ref":"l8"},{"type":"move","who":"sluzhivy","to":"off-left"},{"type":"move","who":"sluzhivy-ryadovoy","to":"off-left"},{"type":"line","ref":"l9"}]}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1r2px86.de","jokeId":"de-witze-1r2px86","locale":"de","adaptation":"original","notes":"Pure dialogue, words kept; 'antwortet der Chef streng' becomes the boss's angry delivery. The wife is only mentioned, so she is not on screen.","title":"Früher gehen","location":"ofis","cast":["paren","nachalnik"],"roles":{"paren":"employee","nachalnik":"boss"},"lines":[{"character":"paren","text":"Chef, darf ich heute zwei Stunden früher gehen? Meine Frau will mit mir shoppen.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"nachalnik","text":"Kommt gar nicht in Frage!","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.8},{"character":"paren","text":"Vielen Dank, Chef! Ich wusste, ich kann mich auf Sie verlassen!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1r2px86.ru","jokeId":"de-witze-1r2px86","locale":"ru","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Line-by-line translation of a three-line dialogue; the wife is only mentioned.","title":"Уйти пораньше","location":"ofis","cast":["paren","nachalnik"],"roles":{"paren":"employee","nachalnik":"boss"},"lines":[{"character":"paren","text":"Шеф, можно я сегодня уйду на два часа пораньше? Жена хочет со мной по магазинам пройтись.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"nachalnik","text":"Об этом не может быть и речи!","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.8},{"character":"paren","text":"Огромное спасибо, шеф! Я знал, что на вас можно положиться!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1r2px86.en","jokeId":"de-witze-1r2px86","locale":"en","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Line-by-line translation of a three-line dialogue; the wife is only mentioned.","title":"Leaving Early","location":"ofis","cast":["paren","nachalnik"],"roles":{"paren":"employee","nachalnik":"boss"},"lines":[{"character":"paren","text":"Boss, can I leave two hours early today? My wife wants to go shopping with me.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"nachalnik","text":"That's out of the question!","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.8},{"character":"paren","text":"Thank you so much, boss! I knew I could count on you!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1rf79c9.de","jokeId":"de-witze-1rf79c9","locale":"de","adaptation":"original","notes":"Dialogue kept word for word; the father's last speech split so the pick-up line lands last. The son is a boy of about ten, so the schoolboy puppet (unnamed) instead of the young guy.","title":"Adoptiert","location":"gostinaya","cast":["muzhik","vovochka"],"roles":{"muzhik":"father","vovochka":"child"},"lines":[{"character":"muzhik","text":"Kind, wir müssen reden! Du bist adoptiert!","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"vovochka","text":"Was?! Ich möchte sofort zu meinen echten Eltern!","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Kind, wir sind deine echten Eltern!","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.6},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Und jetzt pack deine Tasche. Du wirst in dreißig Minuten abgeholt.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}]}
